{
	"name": "Bowling Bear",
	"short_name": "Bowling Bear",
	"description": "Ten-pin bowling in 3D for phones on the same Wi-Fi, with no server: phones join by scanning each other's QR codes, then each bowler swipes up to roll and curves the swipe to hook, on a shared score sheet. Or practise alone",
